DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
10053::$$$message_0076_0000_0000$$$::Lunch time.[lr]::
10054::$$$message_0076_0000_0001$$$::I suppose I'll go buy something at the cafeteria and then I'll most likely eat at the student council room or the roof.::
10055::$$$message_0076_0001_0000$$$::"...Hey, did you see that?"[lr]::
10056::$$$message_0076_0001_0001$$$::"That was quite something. Man, she's actually real, huh?"[lr]::
10057::$$$message_0076_0001_0002$$$::"Even if the girls in our class fused together into one creature, it's debatable whether they could beat her."[lr]::
10058::$$$message_0076_0001_0003$$$::"Such a beauty really exists, huh? Is she a model? A celebrity?"[lr]::
10059::$$$message_0076_0001_0004$$$::"No, an alien. There's no beauty like her on this Earth."[lr]::
10060::$$$message_0076_0001_0005$$$::"...It doesn't matter whether she's from Earth or Mars, but whichever it is, why would someone like that come to this school?"::
10061::$$$message_0076_0002_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
10062::$$$message_0076_0002_0001$$$::I hear such a conversation going on.[lr]::
10063::$$$message_0076_0002_0002$$$::[font italic=true]Who could it be? Is someone like a model actually here?[font italic=false]::
10064::$$$message_0076_0003_0000$$$::"I wonder how she takes care of her hair."[lr]::
10065::$$$message_0076_0003_0001$$$::"That's not all, she's like a different species. Ugh, she absolutely outclasses any of us on physique alone."[lr]::
10066::$$$message_0076_0003_0002$$$::"Her limbs are so long. I was embarrassed just passing by her."[lr]::
10067::$$$message_0076_0003_0003$$$::"Her head to body ratio is crazy, she's like all legs."::
10068::$$$message_0076_0004_0000$$$::This is the appraisal of the girls that I hear.[lr]::
10069::$$$message_0076_0004_0001$$$::I feel like the more that I head downwards, the more I hear whoever it is being talked about.::
10070::$$$message_0076_0005_0000$$$::With this much information gathered, I can only think of one candidate.[lr]::
10071::$$$message_0076_0005_0001$$$::...But why is she at Homurahara?::
10072::$$$message_0076_0006_0000$$$::"...I have a bad feeling about this."[lr]::
10073::$$$message_0076_0006_0001$$$::"That is unfortunate, Shirou.[lr]::
10074::$$$message_0076_0006_0002$$$::Would I be the cause of this premonition?"::
10075::$$$message_0076_0007_0000$$$::A cool voice descends from above me.[lr]::
10076::$$$message_0076_0007_0001$$$::Everyone surrounding me buzzes with excitement.[lr]::
10077::$$$message_0076_0007_0002$$$::"W-who are you!?"[lr]::
10078::$$$message_0076_0007_0003$$$::My voice cracks at my first response.::
10079::$$$message_0076_0008_0000$$$::"It troubles me for you to suddenly play dumb."[lr]::
10080::$$$message_0076_0008_0001$$$::Her tone is cool.[lr]::
10081::$$$message_0076_0008_0002$$$::With a cloth-wrapped bundle in her hand, Rider blocks my way.[lr]::
10082::$$$message_0076_0008_0003$$$::...I can't get through. Or rather, even if I run away, I'll probably get captured right away...::
10083::$$$message_0076_0009_0000$$$::"...Oh, sorry. That's just my knee-jerk reaction as a student. If possible, I wanted to pretend like I didn't know you."[lr]::
10084::$$$message_0076_0009_0001$$$::"How cold of you, Shirou. Even though you always greet me sincerely."::
10085::$$$message_0076_0010_0000$$$::"Oof."[lr]::
10086::$$$message_0076_0010_0001$$$::The spectators roar with surprise.[lr]::
10087::$$$message_0076_0010_0002$$$::I can feel the knife-like thoughts of those around me as if they were spoken aloud. Why is she at Homurahara? There are so many beautiful girls around Emiya. Wasn't there a blonde? Not to mention Tohsaka and Matou's little sister. Come to think of it, even Ryudou is good looking, etc.::
10088::$$$message_0076_0011_0000$$$::I feel small and like I'm being raked over the coals.[sestop time=2000 nowait=1][lr]::
10089::$$$message_0076_0011_0001$$$::My heart creaks from the scrutiny.::
10090::$$$message_0076_0012_0000$$$::"Well, I'm at school right now, so there's a certain way I have to behave as a student... So. What do you want, Rider?"[lr]::
10091::$$$message_0076_0012_0001$$$::"Here. I came to bring something you forgot."::
10092::$$$message_0076_0013_0000$$$::Woahhh, an older wife!? Another older wife-type like the one with Mr. Kuzuki!?[lr]::
10093::$$$message_0076_0013_0001$$$::[font italic=true]Even as a joke, that's really pushing it. Can't you guys at least start with an older sister and younger brother relationship?[font italic=false]::
10094::$$$message_0076_0014_0000$$$::"Me? I didn't forget anything."[lr]::
10095::$$$message_0076_0014_0001$$$::"To be exact, I came to deliver something Sakura forgot,[cacheimage storage=ライダー私服01e(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=ライダー私服01e(中) textoff=0] but..."[lr]::
10096::$$$message_0076_0014_0002$$$::Rider takes a glance around the area.[lr]::
10097::$$$message_0076_0014_0003$$$::Since her beauty is so overpowering, the spectators retreat like how a low tide moves away from the shore.[lr]::
10098::$$$message_0076_0014_0004$$$::The third-year hallway, despite it being lunch break, goes silent.::
10099::$$$message_0076_0015_0000$$$::"It is rather busy here.[lr]::
10100::$$$message_0076_0015_0001$$$::Is there a good place to talk?"[lr]::
10101::$$$message_0076_0015_0002$$$::"...Let's go to the rooftop."[lr]::
10102::$$$message_0076_0015_0003$$$::The number of students that eat lunch at the rooftop during this season isn't small, but it's better than the spectators that surround us here.[lr]::
10103::$$$message_0076_0015_0004$$$::I don't know which part of my body was doing the walking as I pushed through the crowd...::
10104::$$$message_0076_0016_0000$$$::"I guess here is good.[lr]::
10105::$$$message_0076_0016_0001$$$::Man, I'm impressed you were able to get inside, Rider."[lr]::
10106::$$$message_0076_0016_0002$$$::"I had no trouble getting into the building."[lr]::
10107::$$$message_0076_0016_0003$$$::...I feel like she's missing the point, but whatever.[lr]::
10108::$$$message_0076_0016_0004$$$::Rider, who came to the rooftop, is still holding the bundle.::
10109::$$$message_0076_0017_0000$$$::"You said it was what Sakura forgot... But, what does that have to do with me?"[lr]::
10110::$$$message_0076_0017_0001$$$::"This is your lunch."[lr]::
10111::$$$message_0076_0017_0002$$$::There is a lunch box inside the cloth that Rider offered.[lr]::
10112::$$$message_0076_0017_0003$$$::Oh... I see, that's why she was looking for me.::
10113::$$$message_0076_0018_0000$$$::"Did Sakura make my lunch but wasn't able to give it to me or something?"[lr]::
10114::$$$message_0076_0018_0001$$$::"No, she forgot both her own and your lunch. That is why I came to deliver them. I found Sakura right away."[lr]::
10115::$$$message_0076_0018_0002$$$::I bet she found her around the kyudo club. She's been busy assuming the position of captain, so she must've forgotten... Not like her at all.::
10116::$$$message_0076_0019_0000$$$::"It seems like she is busy right now, so she asked me to deliver this to you."[lr]::
10117::$$$message_0076_0019_0001$$$::"I see. Thanks."[lr]::
10118::$$$message_0076_0019_0002$$$::I'm grateful that I get to eat lunch that Sakura made.[lr]::
10119::$$$message_0076_0019_0003$$$::[clfg textoff=0 pos=all time=300]I open the lid, while expressing my thanks.[lr]::
10120::$$$message_0076_0019_0004$$$::Ground meat bowl, eh? Octopus-shaped sausages and bunny-shaped apples.::
10121::$$$message_0076_0020_0000$$$::"Please thank Sakura, not me."[lr]::
10122::$$$message_0076_0020_0001$$$::"That's true. But you came to deliver it."[lr]::
10123::$$$message_0076_0020_0002$$$::Before I know it, Rider is sitting in front of me too.[lr]::
10124::$$$message_0076_0020_0003$$$::...I thought she would leave like the wind once she'd delivered the lunch, but today was different.::
10125::$$$message_0076_0021_0000$$$::"Rider?"[lr]::
10126::$$$message_0076_0021_0001$$$::"I figured I would wait until you finish eating."[lr]::
10127::$$$message_0076_0021_0002$$$::"[shock vmax=20 time=400 count=-3]Mgh!?"[lr]::
10128::$$$message_0076_0021_0003$$$::I accidentally swallow the apple that I put in my mouth whole.::
10129::$$$message_0076_0022_0000$$$::"I figured I would leave after collecting the lunch boxes. I have also conveyed this message to Sakura."[lr]::
10130::$$$message_0076_0022_0001$$$::"I guess it wouldn't become extra luggage for me, but that's..."::
10131::$$$message_0076_0023_0000$$$::Rider is right in front of me.[lr]::
10132::$$$message_0076_0023_0001$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=ライダー私服01a(近) textoff=0]And a suffocating atmosphere drifts in just with that.[lr]::
10133::$$$message_0076_0023_0002$$$::I feel as if I'm being monitored by a teacher not to leave any food that I don't like unfinished.::
10134::$$$message_0076_0024_0000$$$::"...Rider, um."[lr]::
10135::$$$message_0076_0024_0001$$$::"Yes, what is it?"[lr]::
10136::$$$message_0076_0024_0002$$$::"Do you want some?"[lr]::
10137::$$$message_0076_0024_0003$$$::I offer her an octopus sausage held between my chopsticks.::
10138::$$$message_0076_0025_0000$$$::"No, that is your lunch."[lr]::
10139::$$$message_0076_0025_0001$$$::"You don't need lunch?"[lr]::
10140::$$$message_0076_0025_0002$$$::"...Please do not worry about my meals."[lr]::
10141::$$$message_0076_0025_0003$$$::Even if she says that, it doesn't feel right eating by myself.[lr]::
10142::$$$message_0076_0025_0004$$$::I want to share some with Rider, but unfortunately, there's only one set of chopsticks.::
10143::$$$message_0076_0026_0000$$$::"All right. Got it, wait right here."[lr]::
10144::$$$message_0076_0026_0001$$$::I close my lunch box and start running.[lr]::
10145::$$$message_0076_0026_0002$$$::"Shirou!?"[lr]::
10146::$$$message_0076_0026_0003$$$::"Stay right there and protect my lunch, Rider!"::
10147::$$$message_0076_0027_0000$$$::"Haaah haaah, here's a ham sandwich and strawberry milk."[lr]::
10148::$$$message_0076_0027_0001$$$::"...What is this?"[lr]::
10149::$$$message_0076_0027_0002$$$::"I got you lunch."::
10150::$$$message_0076_0028_0000$$$::I hand over a bag from the cafeteria.::
10151::$$$message_0076_0029_0000$$$::"I said I do not need lunch..."[lr]::
10152::$$$message_0076_0029_0001$$$::"I wouldn't know how to fill the time if you don't eat.[lr]::
10153::$$$message_0076_0029_0002$$$::If you want to wait until I'm done with lunch, give up and keep me company."::
10154::$$$message_0076_0030_0000$$$::It sure would be uncomfortable if she just sat there staring blankly at me while I ate.[lr]::
10155::$$$message_0076_0030_0001$$$::With a perplexed expression, Rider takes the triangular sandwich out of the bag.::
10156::$$$message_0076_0031_0000$$$::"...You say some odd things, Shirou."[lr]::
10157::$$$message_0076_0031_0001$$$::"Consider it a tip for coming all the way here."[lr]::
10158::$$$message_0076_0031_0002$$$::"...I understand. In that case, thank you very much."[lr]::
10159::$$$message_0076_0031_0003$$$::Rider finally seems convinced.[lr]::
10160::$$$message_0076_0031_0004$$$::[clfg textoff=0 pos=all time=300]I can eat Sakura's homemade lunch in peace now.::
10161::$$$message_0076_0032_0000$$$::Rider is also nibbling on her sandwich.[lr]::
10162::$$$message_0076_0032_0001$$$::...Well, I suppose nibbling isn't quite the right word.[lr]::
10163::$$$message_0076_0032_0002$$$::It's far more...elegant? It's more elegant than that.[lr]::
10164::$$$message_0076_0032_0003$$$::She finishes her meal in five bites, but there's something cool in the way she manages to put it away. [lr]::
10165::$$$message_0076_0032_0004$$$::I do think she ought to maybe savor the meal a little more, though.::
10166::$$$message_0076_0033_0000$$$::"Shirou. You aren't eating."[lr]::
10167::$$$message_0076_0033_0001$$$::"Oh. Yeah."[lr]::
10168::$$$message_0076_0033_0002$$$::What a distracting lunch.::
10169::$$$message_0076_0034_0000$$$::Rider stares at the straw as she drinks her milk...[lr]::
10170::$$$message_0076_0034_0001$$$::"Shirou, you sure are restless today."[lr]::
10171::$$$message_0076_0034_0002$$$::[clfg textoff=0 pos=all time=300]I hurriedly bury myself into finishing my lunch.[lr]::
10172::$$$message_0076_0034_0003$$$::Man, I'm a little embarrassed by all this... Should I have eaten by myself?::
10173::$$$message_0076_0035_0000$$$::"Thank you for the meal."[lr]::
10174::$$$message_0076_0035_0001$$$::She must've been carefully keeping pace with me, as she finishes at the same time I do.::
10175::$$$message_0076_0036_0000$$$::"Me too... Yeah, that was good.[lr]::
10176::$$$message_0076_0036_0001$$$::Tell Sakura I said that it was good."[lr]::
10177::$$$message_0076_0036_0002$$$::"Understood. Then, excuse me, I'll be collecting her lunch box as well."::
10178::$$$message_0076_0037_0000$$$::[clfg textoff=0 rule=シャッター左から pos=all time=300]As if by magic, Rider crosses the roof in an instant.[lr]::
10179::$$$message_0076_0037_0001$$$::[line len=3]As I was admiring her hair and ribbon fluttering in the wind, she looks back as she opens the door.::
10180::$$$message_0076_0038_0000$$$::"I appreciate your consideration, Shirou."[lr]::
10181::$$$message_0076_0038_0001$$$::"Sure. I'm happy to do this anytime."[lr]::
10182::$$$message_0076_0038_0002$$$::Now...[clfg textoff=0 rule=シャッター左から pos=all time=400] I should go back to class.::
910146::$$$message_9076_0026_0003$$$::"Stay right there and protect my lunch, Rider!"[r]::

